{
  "_about": "Resident challenges (postgame; docs/mods/resident-challenges.md). Once the game is beaten, at every midnight one recruited resident of these rows leaves its home and waits at its recruit site, stronger; won once, it goes home with its reward and nobody else goes out that day; lost, it waits all day. tools/balance.py writes `rule`, `save` and each row's species and sheet stats into MOD_CHALLENGE (tools/city_residents.py challenge_table); the story (story/mods/what-the-island-forgot) has the rest of each row: `story` checks its constant (state.py CH_<NAME> = row number), site, exit path, item and bits.",
